#: ../../source/python/explanation/three-tier-api.md:1
msgid "Why there are three ways to build the same model"
msgstr "Mengapa ada tiga cara membangun model yang sama"

#: ../../source/python/explanation/three-tier-api.md:3
msgid "Each interface asks for one decision fewer than the one above it."
msgstr "Setiap antarmuka meminta satu keputusan lebih sedikit daripada antarmuka di atasnya."

#: ../../source/python/explanation/three-tier-api.md:5
msgid "The question"
msgstr "Pertanyaannya"

#: ../../source/python/explanation/three-tier-api.md:7
msgid "Three functions build the same model. `hbm_gaussian()` takes a response and a list of auxiliary variables. `hbm_flex()` takes the same plus a family. `create_model()` takes a formula. Which one is the real API, and what are the others for?"
msgstr "Tiga fungsi membangun model yang sama. `hbm_gaussian()` menerima respons dan daftar variabel penyerta. `hbm_flex()` menerima hal yang sama ditambah family. `create_model()` menerima formula. Mana API yang sesungguhnya, dan untuk apa yang lain?"

#: ../../source/python/explanation/three-tier-api.md:11
msgid "Background"
msgstr "Latar belakang"

#: ../../source/python/explanation/three-tier-api.md:13
msgid "The R package offers a single entry point in the style of `caret::train()`: one function, with a family argument selecting the model."
msgstr "Paket R menawarkan satu titik masuk bergaya `caret::train()`: satu fungsi, dengan argumen family yang memilih modelnya."

#: ../../source/python/explanation/three-tier-api.md:16
msgid "That design assumes the caller writes model formulas. Someone who knows they have a proportion, three auxiliary variables and a district column may not know the formula language, and should not need it."
msgstr "Rancangan itu mengasumsikan pemanggil menulis formula model. Orang yang tahu bahwa ia punya proporsi, tiga variabel penyerta, dan kolom kabupaten/kota mungkin tidak menguasai bahasa formula, dan semestinya tidak perlu."

#: ../../source/python/explanation/three-tier-api.md:20
msgid "The reasoning"
msgstr "Penalarannya"

#: ../../source/python/explanation/three-tier-api.md:22
msgid "The three interfaces form one chain, each link removing a decision:"
msgstr "Ketiga antarmuka membentuk satu rantai, dengan setiap mata rantai menghilangkan satu keputusan:"

#: ../../source/python/explanation/three-tier-api.md
msgid "Interface"
msgstr "Antarmuka"

#: ../../source/python/explanation/three-tier-api.md
msgid "You supply"
msgstr "Yang Anda berikan"

#: ../../source/python/explanation/three-tier-api.md
msgid "It decides for you"
msgstr "Yang diputuskan untuk Anda"

#: ../../source/python/explanation/three-tier-api.md
msgid "Beginner: `hbm_beta`, `hbm_gaussian`, `hbm_binomial`"
msgstr "Pemula: `hbm_beta`, `hbm_gaussian`, `hbm_binomial`"

#: ../../source/python/explanation/three-tier-api.md
msgid "response, auxiliary list, the family's own columns"
msgstr "respons, daftar variabel penyerta, kolom milik family itu sendiri"

#: ../../source/python/explanation/three-tier-api.md
msgid "the family and the formula"
msgstr "family dan formula"

#: ../../source/python/explanation/three-tier-api.md
msgid "Intermediate: `hbm_flex`"
msgstr "Menengah: `hbm_flex`"

#: ../../source/python/explanation/three-tier-api.md
msgid "response, auxiliary list, family"
msgstr "respons, daftar variabel penyerta, family"

#: ../../source/python/explanation/three-tier-api.md
msgid "the formula"
msgstr "formulanya"

#: ../../source/python/explanation/three-tier-api.md
msgid "Advanced: `create_model` / `hbm`"
msgstr "Mahir: `create_model` / `hbm`"

#: ../../source/python/explanation/three-tier-api.md
msgid "nothing"
msgstr "tidak ada"

#: ../../source/python/explanation/three-tier-api.md:34
msgid "`create_model` starts with `formula`, `family`, `data`. `hbm_flex` replaces the formula with `response` and `auxiliary`. `hbm_gaussian` also drops `family` and exposes `sampling_var`, the extra column a Gaussian small area model needs."
msgstr "`create_model` dimulai dengan `formula`, `family`, `data`. `hbm_flex` mengganti formula dengan `response` dan `auxiliary`. `hbm_gaussian` juga menghilangkan `family` dan menyediakan `sampling_var`, kolom tambahan yang dibutuhkan model area kecil Gaussian."

#: ../../source/python/explanation/three-tier-api.md:38
msgid "Where a family's own arguments live"
msgstr "Tempat argumen khas sebuah family"

#: ../../source/python/explanation/three-tier-api.md:40
msgid "Only the beginner interface names a family's columns: `hbm_beta` takes `n` and `deff`, and `hbm_binomial` takes `trials`. `hbm_flex` passes them through two generic arguments:"
msgstr "Hanya antarmuka tingkat pemula yang menyebut kolom milik family: `hbm_beta` menerima `n` dan `deff`, dan `hbm_binomial` menerima `trials`. `hbm_flex` menyalurkannya melalui dua argumen umum:"

#: ../../source/python/explanation/three-tier-api.md:51
msgid "`addition_var` is the column the likelihood needs beside the response, and `aux_args` holds the rest. A new family declares its columns in the registry and reaches `hbm_flex` through these two arguments, so `hbm_flex` never changes. At the beginner interface the names stay explicit, so a typo is an immediate `TypeError`."
msgstr "`addition_var` adalah kolom yang dibutuhkan likelihood di samping respons, dan `aux_args` memuat sisanya. Family baru mendeklarasikan kolomnya di registri dan mencapai `hbm_flex` melalui kedua argumen ini, sehingga `hbm_flex` tidak pernah berubah. Di antarmuka tingkat pemula nama-namanya tetap eksplisit, sehingga salah ketik langsung menjadi `TypeError`."

#: ../../source/python/explanation/three-tier-api.md:56
msgid "Why each interface delegates"
msgstr "Mengapa setiap antarmuka mendelegasikan"

#: ../../source/python/explanation/three-tier-api.md:58
msgid "Each interface calls the one after it. The beginner interface fixes the family and calls `hbm_flex`, which builds the formula and calls `create_model`, where validation, group injection and construction happen."
msgstr "Setiap antarmuka memanggil antarmuka sesudahnya. Antarmuka tingkat pemula menetapkan family lalu memanggil `hbm_flex`, yang membangun formula lalu memanggil `create_model`, tempat validasi, penyisipan grup, dan konstruksi terjadi."

#: ../../source/python/explanation/three-tier-api.md:62
msgid "Three separate implementations would be three places for behaviour to drift. A validation rule added to `create_model` but not to `hbm_beta` would make the same model behave differently depending on the function used. Delegation rules that out."
msgstr "Tiga implementasi terpisah berarti tiga tempat bagi perilaku untuk saling menjauh. Aturan validasi yang ditambahkan ke `create_model` tetapi tidak ke `hbm_beta` akan membuat model yang sama berperilaku berbeda tergantung fungsi yang dipakai. Delegasi mencegah hal itu."

#: ../../source/python/explanation/three-tier-api.md:66
msgid "Why the signatures are narrow"
msgstr "Mengapa signature-nya sempit"

#: ../../source/python/explanation/three-tier-api.md:68
msgid "No interface accepts a catch-all `**kwargs`. Every argument is named, and each shortcut exposes only its own family's arguments."
msgstr "Tidak ada antarmuka yang menerima `**kwargs` penampung segala. Setiap argumen dinamai, dan setiap pintasan hanya menyediakan argumen milik family-nya sendiri."

#: ../../source/python/explanation/three-tier-api.md:71
msgid "`hbm_gaussian(..., trials=\"n\")` is therefore a `TypeError` raised by Python at the call, naming the argument. A permissive signature would pass the mistake several layers down, or ignore it and build a different model from the one requested."
msgstr "Karena itu `hbm_gaussian(..., trials=\"n\")` adalah `TypeError` yang dimunculkan Python pada saat pemanggilan, dengan menyebutkan argumennya. Signature yang longgar akan meneruskan kesalahan itu beberapa lapis ke dalam, atau mengabaikannya dan membangun model yang berbeda dari yang diminta."

#: ../../source/python/explanation/three-tier-api.md:75
msgid "Why the advanced interface still exists"
msgstr "Mengapa antarmuka tingkat mahir tetap ada"

#: ../../source/python/explanation/three-tier-api.md:77
msgid "The beginner and intermediate interfaces can add only one random-effect term: the random intercept `(1|area)`, through `area_var=`. Any other term, such as a random slope `(x1|group)`, needs a formula, and a formula needs `create_model`. Transformations and interactions are computed as columns at every interface."
msgstr "Antarmuka tingkat pemula dan menengah hanya dapat menambahkan satu suku efek acak: intersep acak `(1|area)`, melalui `area_var=`. Suku lain, misalnya kemiringan acak `(x1|group)`, membutuhkan formula, dan formula membutuhkan `create_model`. Transformasi dan interaksi dihitung sebagai kolom di semua antarmuka."

#: ../../source/python/explanation/three-tier-api.md:82
msgid "Consequences"
msgstr "Konsekuensi"

#: ../../source/python/explanation/three-tier-api.md:84
msgid "**Start with the simplest interface that can express your model.** It has the fewest arguments to get wrong. Move to the next one when you need something it cannot express."
msgstr "**Mulailah dengan antarmuka paling sederhana yang dapat menyatakan model Anda.** Antarmuka itu memiliki paling sedikit argumen yang bisa salah. Pindah ke antarmuka berikutnya ketika Anda membutuhkan sesuatu yang tidak dapat dinyatakannya."

#: ../../source/python/explanation/three-tier-api.md:87
msgid "**A translated R script uses the advanced interface.** `hbm()` is `create_model()`, so an `hbsaems` call carries over unchanged."
msgstr "**Skrip R yang diterjemahkan memakai antarmuka tingkat mahir.** `hbm()` adalah `create_model()`, sehingga pemanggilan `hbsaems` terbawa tanpa perubahan."

#: ../../source/python/explanation/three-tier-api.md:90
msgid "**`model.formula` is the formula that is fitted.** Whatever the interface, it shows the resolved formula, including the group term added for you."
msgstr "**`model.formula` adalah formula yang di-fit.** Apa pun antarmukanya, atribut ini menampilkan formula yang sudah diselesaikan, termasuk suku grup yang ditambahkan untuk Anda."

#: ../../source/python/explanation/three-tier-api.md:93
msgid "**Family-specific columns are checked against the family** at every interface, so a stray argument fails the same way everywhere."
msgstr "**Kolom khusus family diperiksa terhadap family-nya** di setiap antarmuka, sehingga argumen yang salah tempat gagal dengan cara yang sama di mana pun."

#: ../../source/python/explanation/three-tier-api.md:96
msgid "Related"
msgstr "Terkait"

